sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as ModelMesh gRPC API<br/>8033/TCP TLS(opt)
    participant Core as ModelMesh Core<br/>Routing Engine
    participant Thrift as LiteLinks Thrift<br/>8080/TCP TLS(opt)
    participant RemoteMM as Remote ModelMesh<br/>Instance
    participant Runtime as Co-located Runtime<br/>8085/TCP or UDS<br/>plaintext
    participant RemoteRT as Remote Runtime<br/>8085/TCP or UDS
    participant etcd as etcd Cluster<br/>2379/TCP TLS(opt)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>Scraper

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 1: Model Inference Request

    Client->>API: gRPC inference request<br/>TLS (optional)
    API->>Core: Route request (in-process)

    alt Model loaded locally
        Core->>Runtime: gRPC loadModel/predict<br/>plaintext (localhost/UDS)
        Runtime-->>Core: Prediction result
    else Model on remote instance
        Core->>Thrift: Forward to peer<br/>Thrift/8080 TLS(opt) mTLS(opt)
        Thrift->>RemoteMM: applyModel RPC
        RemoteMM->>RemoteRT: gRPC predict<br/>plaintext (localhost/UDS)
        RemoteRT-->>RemoteMM: Prediction result
        RemoteMM-->>Thrift: Response
        Thrift-->>Core: Response
    end

    Core-->>API: Prediction result
    API-->>Client: gRPC response<br/>TLS (optional)

    Note over Client,etcd: Flow 2: Model Registration & Loading

    Client->>API: registerModel RPC<br/>gRPC/8033 TLS(opt)
    API->>Core: Register model
    Core->>etcd: Store model record<br/>gRPC/2379 TLS(opt)<br/>client cert(opt)
    etcd-->>Core: Confirmed

    Core->>Core: Leader election<br/>selects target instance
    Core->>Thrift: Route to selected instance<br/>Thrift/8080 TLS(opt)
    Thrift->>RemoteMM: applyModel (load)
    RemoteMM->>RemoteRT: loadModel RPC<br/>gRPC/8085 plaintext
    RemoteRT-->>RemoteMM: Load complete + model size
    RemoteMM->>etcd: Update model registry<br/>gRPC/2379 TLS(opt)
    etcd-->>RemoteMM: Confirmed
    RemoteMM-->>Thrift: Load success
    Thrift-->>Core: Response
    Core-->>API: Model registered
    API-->>Client: Registration response

    Note over Prom,Prom: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping

    Prom->>API: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/2112<br/>TLS (self-signed)
    API-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics<br/>(latency, cache, health)
